                <span begin="03:54.259" end="03:54.700">し</span>
                <span begin="03:54.700" end="03:55.260">い</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">没关系 我们比无自信的人更闪耀</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="03:56.195" end="04:02.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">
                <span begin="03:56.195" end="03:57.354">宝</span>
                <span begin="03:57.354" end="03:58.105">物</span>
                <span begin="03:58.105" end="03:58.667">が</span>
                <span begin="03:58.667" end="03:59.042">現</span>
                <span begin="03:59.042" end="03:59.352">在</span>
                <span begin="03:59.352" end="03:59.667">に</span>
                <span begin="03:59.667" end="03:59.854">あ</span>
                <span begin="03:59.854" end="04:00.040">る</span>
                <span begin="04:00.040" end="04:00.290">事</span>
                <span begin="04:00.290" end="04:00.668">を</span>
                <span begin="04:00.668" end="04:00.914">知</span>
                <span begin="04:00.914" end="04:01.288">っ</span>
                <span begin="04:01.288" end="04:01.729">て</span>
                <span begin="04:01.729" end="04:02.730">る</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们了解我们的情况 这就是财富</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="04:02.730" end="04:06.086" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">
                <span begin="04:02.730" end="04:03.354">大</span>
                <span begin="04:03.354" end="04:03.792">丈</span>
                <span begin="04:03.792" end="04:04.184">夫</span>
                <span begin="04:04.184" end="04:04.680">僕</span>
                <span begin="04:04.680" end="04:05.120">ら</span>
                <span begin="04:05.120" end="04:06.086">...</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们没关系的</span>
            </p>
        </div>
    </body>
</tt>
